{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:029f0d51176a532b","name":"Stun Bayonet","source":{"id":"source:reference-029f0d51176a532b","title":"Stun Bayonet","revision":21754,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T02:25:25Z","sha256":"bb39aa832a0a7f0aa762ff0dc126e47179c2932c3ee7b457db409651673492d6","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21754","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Stun%20Bayonet&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-029f0d51176a532b","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Star Wars Miniatures Previews"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Star_Wars_Miniatures_Previews"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When mounted on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifle"},", a Stun Bayonet allows you to use a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifle"}," as a potent melee weapon. Even if you used the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifle"}," to make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," on your last turn, you still ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threaten"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threaten"}," squares within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reach"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reach"}," as long as your Stun Bayonet remains mounted and you can use it to make ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attacks of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity","referenceId":"reference:3f19aef95d530255"},". A Stun Bayonet requires two hands to use when mounted. A Stun Bayonet cannot be used when mounted on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifle"}," with a folded ",{"tag":"a","children":["Retractable Stock"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Retractable_Stock","referenceId":"reference:c46421d1c6248b43"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A detached Stun Bayonet functions as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun Baton"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun_Baton","referenceId":"reference:895573ffa7826a58"},"; a mounted Stun Bayonet deals more damage than a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun Baton"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun_Baton","referenceId":"reference:895573ffa7826a58"}," because of the added leverage and bulk. Because of its implementation into military and police organizations, characters with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Martial Arts I"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Martial_Arts_I","referenceId":"reference:e2ebb2bef3706adf"}," feat and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Proficiency (Rifles)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_(Rifles)"}," treat a Stun Bayonet as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Simple Weapon (Melee)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Simple_Weapon_(Melee)"}," when mounted.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Stun Bayonet requires an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Energy Cell"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Energy_Cell","referenceId":"reference:a3dedb9c17e4ee9d"}," to operate (its power does not drain energy from the Rifle's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"},"). \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Advanced Melee Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Advanced_Melee_Weapons","referenceId":"reference:ffc93dd82af566f8"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Medium\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 500\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 1d6\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," YES (2d8)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 2 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Bludgeoning and Energy\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Restricted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restricted"},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
